title: "Natural Language Processing: From Foundations to Large Language Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Khater"
    given-names: "Eman"
repository-code: "https://github.com/emansafwatm/Natural-Language-Processing-Course"
url: "https://github.com/emansafwatm/Natural-Language-Processing-Course"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A complete university-level Natural Language Processing course spanning
  linguistic foundations, classical NLP, word embeddings, deep learning,
  Transformers, Hugging Face workflows, Large Language Models, machine
  translation, advanced NLP applications, and end-to-end intelligent systems
  through 62 sequential Jupyter notebook lessons.
keywords:
